SUMMARY:Board Games
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nJoin me for a fun 
 day of board games at Mountain Mikes Pizza. Please bring a game you would 
 be willing to teach the group . Feel free to bring a friend.\n\n***This ev
 ent is cross posted with other meetup groups such as Sonoma Marin Brat pac
 k and Marin Millenials so the RSVP do not reflect the actual number of att
 endees ***
