UID:event_315998233@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T021334Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260825T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260825T203000
SUMMARY:Trivia at Trailhead (Novato) 
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n🎉 Join Us for T
 rivia Night! 🧠☕️\nThis event is cross-posted with Sonoma Marin Brat
  Pack\, Marin County Millennials\, and North Bay 20s30s Meetup\, so RSVPs 
 may not reflect the full crowd.\n\nWe’re Team Quizzards! I’ll be at mo
 st events\, and if I can’t make it\, you’ll still find some friendly r
 egulars there. Look for us at the back of the coffee shop — come say hi 
 and join the fun! 🎉\n\n🕡 Trivia kicks off promptly at 6:30 PM\, so s
 wing by a bit earlier if you'd like to grab a drink or something tasty to 
 eat before we get started. I plan to be there at 6 pm to try to get us a g
 ood table .\n📍 Location:\nTrailhead Coffee\n127 San Marin Drive\, Novat
 o\, CA\nBring your friends\, your appetite\, and your A-game — see you t
 here! 🙌
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/315998233/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260806T015212Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260806T015212Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_316081114@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T021334Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260830T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260830T150000
SUMMARY:river hangout riverfront park
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\ncome celebrate the
  summer days with a relaxing beach day at riverfront regional park! We'll 
 set up a spot along the river where you can lounge\, swim\, or just enjoy 
 the sun and good company. we will have to walk about a half mile or so to 
 the river from the parking lot so bring a bag to carry stuff.\n\nFeel free
  to bring snacks\, drinks\, and anything you’d want for a chill day by t
 he water. Whether you’re looking to float\, picnic\, or just kick back\,
  it’ll be a great way to enjoy the long weekend together.\n\nriverfront 
 regional park is a regional park and does require payment for parking so c
 ome prepared.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316081114/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260812T030831Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260812T030831Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
