DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T123000
SUMMARY:Disk golfing at Stafford Lake
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\nJoin us for a fun 
 round of disc golf at the beautiful Stafford Lake Disc Golf Course! With r
 olling hills\, scenic views\, and one of the best courses in the Bay Area\
 , this is the perfect spot to test your skills or learn the game.\n\nThis 
 course has a mix of open fairways and technical wooded shots\, making it a
  great challenge for all skill levels. Bring your own discs\, plenty of wa
 ter\, and be ready for a great time outdoors.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316081127/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260812T031007Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260812T031007Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
